      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "㭴本代理虽太过严格，\n但非常重视成员也是事实。\n向秋川理事长寻问其严格的理由后才得知……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8e2ee394201994152818d97ba65848cd0470da52bd278db4548c31f5582a410",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
