    {
      "uid": "zhcn:147a7f187b532955227639f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "㭴本代理过去曾是尊重自由的优秀训练员。\n但她的签约赛马娘却因为自主训练的\n疲劳而受伤，引退……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0962756bf62483fcb1cb34f25004330ac22b914f59612dde7768419c865a937",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
