      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:322768d56b171496357f373d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "得到的答案是违逆管理，\n即使要进行相当勉强的训练，\n也要拿出超越她计算的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3031c6e257fc5391120d2343843667a3c6153fd0eaa03c6c735a62d2084c6964",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0002/storytimeline_400002429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:296641b2fe5d60556b5b5374",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "长远来看是为了㭴本代理。\n同时也是为了保护这支队伍，\n保护她们终于找到的栖身之处。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf3ae6e23a3b29b55370b83f15a94ed7e2250451bcdd9073ace691a8d5338f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0002/storytimeline_400002429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:777d34d9ab0778f8c8cb48dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，看见开始违逆自己的学生们，\n㭴本代理对“自己的管理再次失败”\n感到懊悔不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88db9c7dd8d302316e9aae78c7ff3832829849627ca1b2d567698254a155fab1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
