      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使快被＜First＞队的气势压过，\n大树快车她们仍想要全力以赴赢得比赛。\n竞赛即将开幕──",
      "source_fingerprint": "20010fcdf447c27a5629c866df407837a7e492b24bf3afe67ea60a08ec00d95e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
