      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面向败北的㭴本代理，\n小小蚕茧们坚定凛然地报告\n今天早上成功超越了目标时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36bb2b5fec1b061831e527268087fff298b132e75ab0c50cb24ed4ae5f26d75d",
